      Set, (#ShelfWidth>#ShelfLength1CC)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength2CC) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthB)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthC): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost2CC , Set the Cost of This Shelf
